<title>BRAZIL: Brazil lets Italian bank raise Sudameris stake.</title>
<headline>Brazil lets Italian bank raise Sudameris stake.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's National Monetary Council (CMN) authorized Italy's Banco Commerziali Italiano to raise to 75 percent from 56 percent its stake in Banco Sudameris Brasil SA, Central Bank officials said.</p>
<p>The officials said after a regular CMN meeting that the operation involved a capital increase of 125 million reais in Sudameris.</p>
<p>The CMN authorization must still be sanctioned by a presidential decree.</p>
<p>((-- Michael Christie, Brasilia newsroom 55-61-2230358))</p>
